{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version of Mind Split is a demo with limited content. It does not include all the features available in the full version of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/757b2527eef055394cf06edd8854bf48.webp?t=1754766237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Split is a top-down puzzle game that challenges you to control two characters moving in opposite directions at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/4c924eb712d6232043eea01bc66e9576.avif?t=1754766237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/7988473f818edb99be3c3cde742a2caa.webp?t=1754766237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the editor mode, you can place the abilities you need in designated areas before the level begins. <br>Careful planning is essential: Which ability will help which character? Think ahead, position wisely, and test your strategy. <br><strong>But beware\u2014there's no going back once you've made your move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.poster.avif?t=1754766237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.webm?t=1754766237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/c65433323b79d410df5746b95974e608.mp4?t=1754766237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/64fcca0b7e7a7df7adf7eb6069e53e04.webp?t=1754766237\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique puzzle experience, you control two characters simultaneously\u2014one can only move in the dark, while the other can only walk in the light. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.poster.avif?t=1754766237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.webm?t=1754766237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865620/extras/93a33a935812834e8aa498010bba55f9.mp4?t=1754766237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Does the Demo Include?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 demo-exclusive levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 usable special mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature multiple map modes, new mechanics, and more advanced levels. This demo is designed to introduce only the core gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan. Execute. Find balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Light and Shadow reunite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailer Music:</strong> &quot;Dj Quads - It Just Makes Me Happy&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865620?t=1754766237","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/store